direction: right
title: Repartition vs Coalesce Mechanics

Coalesce: coalesce(2) (Zero Network Shuffle) {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  P1: Node 1 Part 1
  P2: Node 1 Part 2
  P3: Node 2 Part 3
  P4: Node 2 Part 4
  MergedA: Merged Part A (Local)
  MergedB: Merged Part B (Local)

  P1 -> MergedA
  P2 -> MergedA
  P3 -> MergedB
  P4 -> MergedB
}

Repartition: repartition(2) (Full Network Shuffle) {
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
  RP1: Part 1
  RP2: Part 2
  RP3: Part 3
  RP4: Part 4
  Shuffle: Cluster Network Shuffle (Round-Robin / Hash)
  EvenA: Even Part A
  EvenB: Even Part B

  RP1 -> Shuffle
  RP2 -> Shuffle
  RP3 -> Shuffle
  RP4 -> Shuffle
  Shuffle -> EvenA
  Shuffle -> EvenB
}
